.git
lld/
analysis-engine/
node_modules/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
# TypeScript's incremental build cache (gitignored, but not previously
# dockerignored) — caught 2026-09-09 causing a spurious `tsc -b` failure
# inside the image build: a stale tsconfig.app.tsbuildinfo from an earlier
# point in a long edit session got copied into the build context and
# confused tsc about which lines had which content, reporting an error at
# the wrong line for an identifier that had already been fixed. A fresh
# build must never depend on host-local incremental state.
*.tsbuildinfo
*.md
# ...except the third-party licences, which every image ships under /licenses.
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
*.txt
.claude/
